<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Lookout Mountain from Highway 35 (Road 44, Road 4410)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:218-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.373973" lon="-121.566853"><ele>1008.3</ele><name>Highway 35 at Road 44</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy35-road-44 (OSM node 33436785); confidence: high; pdf_page: 214; book_elev_ft: 3280; quote: All tours in this area are reached by skiing (or driving) uphill on Road 44 from Highway 35 ... (3,280 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.408084" lon="-121.546922"><ele>1306.3</ele><name>Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring</name><desc>source: OSM node 33426868, junction of Brooks Meadow Road (44) and Lookout Mountain Road (4410); OSM Clinger Spring node 45.408783,-121.550818 is 300 m west; confidence: high; pdf_page: 215; book_elev_ft: 4200; quote: Ski past Clinger Spring about 200 yards and turn right (uphill) onto Road 4410, the Lookout Mountain road.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.351810" lon="-121.533953"><ele>1818.8</ele><name>Road 4410 / Road 4420 junction below High Prairie</name><desc>source: OSM node 476241574, end of Lookout Mountain Road (4410) at Forest Road 4420; High Prairie Trailhead parking 0.1 mi east on 4420; confidence: high; pdf_page: 220; book_elev_ft: 6000; quote: Continue up to High Prairie, a large meadow at 6,000 feet just below Lookout Mountain.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.342503" lon="-121.524188"><ele>1991.4</ele><name>Lookout Mountain summit</name><desc>source: OSM peak node 357311985; confidence: high; pdf_page: 220; book_elev_ft: 6525; quote: bear right to the open west shoulder of the summit ridge. On a good day the summit view is spectacular.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Lookout Mountain from Highway 35 (Road 44, Road 4410)</name><desc>1. Highway 35 at Road 44 -&gt; Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring: osm (high), 3.78 mi | 2. Road 44 / Road 4410 junction, 200 yd past Clinger Spring -&gt; Road 4410 / Road 4420 junction below High Prairie: osm (high), 4.69 mi | 3. Road 4410 / Road 4420 junction below High Prairie -&gt; Lookout Mountain summit: osm (medium), 1.46 mi</desc>
